        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;AI Script: Infinite Text Adventures&quot;, an infinite text adventure game powered by an AI Game Master (GM). Experience the future of gaming that captures the magic of classic tabletop role-playing (TRPG), featuring AI-driven, never-repeating storylines and strategic dice-rolls that determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>An AI Game Master with a Mind of Its Own</strong><br>Your AI GM has its own &quot;personality&quot;. It might be a generous benefactor, smoothing your path; or it could be a harsh judge, setting daunting challenges for your journey. With each new game, you will face an unknown GM, ready for unexpected surprises and shocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>An Infinite Universe of Stories</strong><br>At the heart of the game is a powerful AI script generator. It builds worlds for you, generates characters, and weaves completely original storylines. No two adventures are the same, as every choice opens a new narrative branch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>The Soul of TRPG: Strategy &amp; Luck</strong><br>When faced with crucial choices (ABCD) presented by the AI, you must weigh their different success rates. Roll the decisive dice and feel the dramatic tension where strategy meets luck, hanging in the balance between success and failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Your Adventure Starts Now</strong><br>The initial version of the game launches with the &quot;Starship Journey&quot; campaign, taking you to explore the mysteries of the vast cosmos. More diverse script worlds are planned for the future, aiming to expand your horizons of adventure indefinitely (Note: DLC plans are subject to change based on development progress).</p>",
